[Fact:sinsister:The Sinsister Crypt]
With pictures switched on, room #N$1E ("A Sinister Foreboding Crypt") is
described by its short text, which is stored tokenised at #R$75CE(#N$784C).
That text reads "you are in a sinsister foreboding crypt", with "sinister"
misspelled. The typo is in the original game, so the bytes are left exactly
as they are, but the caption on the room's picture at #R$BA8D corrects the
spelling to "Sinister". The long description in bank 6, used when pictures
are switched off, doesn't use the word.

